Keeps this directory in git.

The Finance module serves JSON only -- every screen is React, so there are no
Blade templates here and there may never be. The directory still has to exist,
because nwidart's ModuleServiceProvider::registerViews() calls loadViewsFrom()
on it unconditionally (unlike registerTranslations(), which guards with
is_dir()). Without the directory, `php artisan view:cache` aborts the whole
deployment with:

    The "<...>/Modules/Finance/resources/views" directory does not exist.

Git does not track empty directories, so this file is the only thing that
makes the path survive a clone. Do not delete it. If Finance ever gains a PDF
template, it goes here and this file can go.
